SCOPE

The MIT licence above covers the code, configuration and documentation in this
repository.

It does NOT cover the training corpus. The contents of `training/corpus/`,
`training/qa/` and `training/mlx/` are the full text of Marc C. Deller's D.Phil.
thesis, papers, patents, posters and website, together with question-and-answer
pairs derived from them. Those remain under their original copyright, are not
redistributed with this repository, and are excluded by `.gitignore`.

What ships is the pipeline that builds a corpus, not the corpus:
`training/build_jsonl.py`, `training/fetch_sources.py`, `training/README.md` and
`training/system_prompt.md` are covered by the MIT licence above.

The trained model weights published to the Hugging Face Hub are released
separately under Apache 2.0, matching the licence of the Qwen3 base model.
